window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Book burning. Jewel stealing. Vampire hunting.</b></p> <p>Not exactly what I expected from a day's work as a detective, but at least things are no longer dull at the agency.</p> <p>Although I'm not sure how much longer the doors to that agency will be open, since the due date for getting my detective license just went whizzing by faster than a fairy on pixie dust.</p> <p>But, after making good use of my groveling skills, HQ has given me an extension to solve a case and complete my application. Which would be great if the only clients I have weren't dead clients, missing clients, and persnickety clients.</p> <p>I'm also contending with a boyfriend who's refusing to speak to me, there's a vampire uprising close on the horizon, and more Magics going missing by the day, including my own parents (yes, again).</p> <p>But the worst problem in my life right now? A bubbly new assistant, who not only believes we're besties, but also thinks hugging is permitted.</p> <p>Seriously, I'll take a vampire uprising over that, any day.</p>"; 
